the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=txNJT-Zla58Q7kNvwFQbV8-&_nc_oc=AdpHJQlOjeDDiuYHCOsFOw_1kmldJouN65tfp5AYrC7ozFqjJKXUO_ekI87Hf3g1Yho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNuGuRu2LOouRE12SW1iiOzV8Eks0HV5KmHxOpmm0O9-w&oe=6AC51283"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ia4g6PM0cL8Q7kNvwEq1Vdl&_nc_oc=AdpCwkqyEgPjqL4PE9xKh_PF9Dj-qtWMKHqiFuHrh_nof2XDNgXOemr2iHiioriiEMs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOZz47eUIXgXjlAr87wfutEc8-T6-5GRLaQUN1odg_tGA&oe=6AC50AD8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i1xNAf6WGBUQ7kNvwEj-gmO&_nc_oc=AdowsJibM6hWKJVssU340Am2LoPr340DqIDlk3cTPCec3gFAFnWGrrludaU71AuIAMs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN2oF_eEQzgbM0-pb4kOT0Cvn4njamsGx_AOPwWYN-vXw&oe=6AC51DFC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080